      "jp": "その日、僕はラゴスさんに呼ばれて食堂へやってきていた。\nすると、彼女は大きなバケツを抱えて近づいてくる。",
      "jp_sha256": "943c3a2d7d11d07185095cad0add06015ea7a3d01ad9159adb3b9add9db5bb74",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "그날 나는 라고스 씨에게 불려 식당으로 와 있었다.\n그러자 그녀가 커다란 양동이를 안고 다가왔다.",
      "message_index_0based": 0,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 8,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b005-20261106-resume-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "e07f67756c43d1318783be883530bf87a1f40a1490ffe8343ad2d7856cf776bc:000000_-5148720118476368372:g0:r7",
      "row_index_0based": 7,
      "serialized_row_index": 7,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "その日、僕はラゴスさんに呼ばれて食堂へやってきていた。\nすると、彼女は大きなバケツを抱えて近づいてくる。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "c03da89685f2bc734ae18e2c06e5e6ffb8b59668e52035691530276268d4200b",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 1,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "こんにちは、ラゴスさん。僕に用があるって……いえ。\nそれより、そのバケツ、重そうですね……。\n何に使うんですか？",
      "jp_sha256": "00a1057738ff055a6933c33aaaed6bc7e57f4999efe90d7292bc79b32ccc3e5b",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "안녕하세요, 라고스 씨. 제게 볼일이 있다고…… 아니.\n그보다 그 양동이 무거워 보이네요……\n어디에 쓰는 건가요?",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 9,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b005-20261106-resume-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "e07f67756c43d1318783be883530bf87a1f40a1490ffe8343ad2d7856cf776bc:000000_-5148720118476368372:g0:r8",
      "row_index_0based": 8,
      "serialized_row_index": 8,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "こんにちは、ラゴスさん。僕に用があるって……いえ。\nそれより、そのバケツ、重そうですね……。\n何に使うんですか？"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "6234093bad489c81123bf6fb5bbfb1cdbcbdb2a713e1d895fa1e5ab5413269cc",
